{"id":"a2427ac4523911c5","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-cover.md","title":"Cover","display":"df-cover — Cover","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cover","aliases":["58-df-cover","Cover","Open Cover"],"display":"df-cover — Cover","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cover</span><span>Cover</span><span>Open Cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cover — Cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cover}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Cover}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (本文件定义的带环境载体覆盖谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal U,A,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal U,A,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>环境载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是谓词的显式第三参数，避免同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在不同载体中产生隐藏语义。</li>\n<li>Cover: collection whose union contains the set</li>\n<li>Open cover: cover consisting of open sets</li>\n<li>Lindelof: every open cover has countable subcover</li>\n<li>Compact: every open cover has finite subcover</li>\n<li>Refinement: cover where each set is contained in some set of another cover</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology, Chapter 4</li>\n<li>Engelking, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)$ (see [[58-df-powerset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cover}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cover}_S(\\mathcal U,A,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1095,"backlinks":[{"id":"29039c5a9838faa3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57d164c83dae12df","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal U \\subseteq \\mathcal P(X)$ (cover family, see [[58-df-cover]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-378","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cover.md|58-df-cover]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}